---
code: field.name.lower-dot-case
description: Convert field names to lower dot case (URLValue -> url.value)
default-enabled: false
---

# Matches Jackson's LowerDotCaseStrategy: acronyms are split at word boundaries
# in the same way as the kebab-case and snake-case strategies.
field.name=groovy:```
    return tool.toLowerDotCase(it.fieldName())
```
